---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---

<BaseLayout
  current="About"
  title="About HJH | dreamkeeperhu"
  description="About Jianheng Hu: Beihang freshman, robotics interests, sim-to-real transfer, CCHIHH research, and small tools."
>
  <section class="profile-hero" aria-label="About Jianheng Hu">
    <div class="profile-title">
      <span>ABOUT</span>
      <h1>HJH</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="profile-copy">
      <p>I'm <strong>Jianheng Hu (胡健恒)</strong>, a freshman at Beihang University.</p>
      <p>I grew up in Chengdu and came to Beijing for university. The transition wasn't exactly what I had planned - but it's where I am, and I'm making the most of it.</p>
      <p>My research interest is embodied intelligence: getting robots to understand instructions, generalize across environments, and act reliably in the real world. Right now I'm focused on sim-to-real transfer - the gap between what a robot learns in simulation and what actually works when you deploy it.</p>
      <p>On the side, I've been working on a paper about Cloud-Edge-Device collaborative scheduling, the CCHIHH algorithm, which sits at the intersection of evolutionary computation and multi-armed bandits.</p>
      <p>I also write small tools when I find something annoying enough to fix.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="profile-band" aria-label="Profile summary">
    <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>
      <span>Email</span>
      <strong>{profile.email}</strong>
    </a>
    <a href="/research">
      <span>Research</span>
      <strong>Robotics and sim-to-real</strong>
    </a>
    <a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <span>GitHub</span>
      <strong>@{profile.handle}</strong>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section" aria-label="What I explore">
    <div class="section-head compact-head">
      <h2>What I Explore</h2>
      <p>当前公开项目仍在打地基，研究方向会逐步聚焦到机器人指令、真实世界泛化和下一代机器人范式。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-panel-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Robotics Instruction</h3>
        <p>探索如何让机器人更好理解任务、约束和人类意图，让 instruction 成为可靠行动的起点。</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Sim-to-real Generalization</h3>
        <p>关注从仿真到真实机器人的迁移，让策略、数据和评估更能跨环境稳定工作。</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>New Robotics Paradigm</h3>
        <p>探索一种能把感知、控制、记忆、世界模型和泛化能力连起来的机器人范式。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="split-section" aria-label="How I work">
    <div class="section-head compact-head">
      <h2>How I Work</h2>
      <p>我会从小工具和可复现实验开始，把问题拆清楚，再把它们逐步连接到更大的机器人智能目标。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row-list">
      <a class="list-row" href="/notes">
        <span class="row-index">01</span>
        <span class="row-copy">
          <strong>Start from concrete friction</strong>
          <small>先解决明确的低效和不稳定，再让工具和实验服务更长期的问题。</small>
        </span>
        <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="list-row" href="/research">
        <span class="row-index">02</span>
        <span class="row-copy">
          <strong>Keep experiments reproducible</strong>
          <small>让参数、数据入口和评估方式尽量清楚，方便后续扩展到机器人场景。</small>
        </span>
        <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="list-row" href="/now">
        <span class="row-index">03</span>
        <span class="row-copy">
          <strong>Seek the next paradigm</strong>
          <small>把项目、问题和想法整理成结构，慢慢逼近下一代机器人系统的工作方式。</small>
        </span>
        <span class="row-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <div>
      <h2>Keep In Touch</h2>
      <p>If you're working on robotics, sim-to-real, or embodied AI - or just want to talk - reach out.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="contact-link" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>
      {profile.email}
      <span>→</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
